WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.980
Going back to the Demon World?

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:03.980
Who?

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.050
The doctor guy.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:08.480
The squirt and the one with 
half-assed character design.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.090
An enemy has appeared!

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.060
With Baby Beel all better, they 
didn't have any reason to be here.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.280
They said it was about time they 
headed back to the Demon World.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:20.770
Seriously...

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.000
<b>HonMAKAI</b>

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.000
<b>Honmakai = Seriously
Makai = Demon World</b>

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:16.990
<b>Are you Kidding Me? The Demon World</b>

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:19.260
<b>HonMAKAI</b>

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:18.870
Lame!

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:23.080
Just try saying that pun again.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:25.750
We're heading back to the Demon World!

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:26.400
Come on...

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.580
Shut up! Just go already!

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:31.620
That was our intent.

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:34.090
But I can't seem to find Alaindelon.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:37.570
You live together with him, 
yes? Do you know anything?

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:39.680
Nope, I dunno.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:42.540
I see. That <i>is</i> a problem.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:46.920
Doctor, why don't we wait until tomorrow?

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:49.270
I wanna stay together with 
Beelze-sama a little longer!

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.520
Fool!

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:53.160
I have flocks of patients back 
in the Demon World, you know!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.500
Why don't you simply call for him?

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:02.160
Perhaps he will come if someone 
near-and-dear calls for him, Furuichi.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.270
I wouldn't say I'm near-and...

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:08.840
Do it! Or are you gonna spout 
that lame pun at Miss Hilda?

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.010
Lame pun?

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:11.470
Right! You see...

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:13.230
Wait, I'll call for him!

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:14.880
Just don't say it to Hilda-san!

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.210
You'll call him for us?

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:20.550
Well, if it's something you request...

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:23.380
That will do, however...

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:26.140
<b>HonMAKAI</b>

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.960
That pun wasn't funny.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.420
Now you're just rubbing it in!

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.420
Hurry up and call him.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.760
All of you just shut up!

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:38.860
Calling someone near-and-dear...

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.600
At this point, I've got a sure-fire 
way of getting him here.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:45.520
I won't call for him.

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.410
You called?

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.440
Impressive.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:53.990
I'll give you credit for that.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:58.250
I didn't call for you!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:01.240
1, 2, 3, 4...

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:05.930
Um... Is there some reason 
we're going elsewhere?

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:09.960
Yes. Transferring to the 
Demon World is special.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.390
We have to cross dimensions.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:17.020
It requires the natural energy 
of rivers or mountains.

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:22.440
Plus, there is a limit to the amount of 
mass that can be transferred at once.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:28.480
I believe that Alaindelon can safely 
transfer no more than 2 people.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.740
Just a sec!

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:33.660
You still want something?

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:37.710
Not <i>you</i>! I wanted to say 
farewell to Beelze-sama!

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.170
Oh, right.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:40.190
Here.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:45.250
I wish you could just take him home instead.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:47.430
I'd like to do that too!

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:53.180
But if Beelze-sama gets more that 15 meters 
from you, you'd be lethally electrocuted...

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:56.880
That means you'd die!

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:04.700
Beelze-sama... Make sure to 
become a wonderful Demon Lord!

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:09.310
And remember... No matter what, 
I'm on your side, Beelze-sama!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.730
We'll be counting on you.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:19.130
Until we meet again, Lamia.

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:22.030
Miss Hilda!

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.640
Miss Hilda!

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.970
It's about time we left!

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:33.830
Then...

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.130
Farewell!

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:45.410
The Demon World, huh?

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:47.190
I wonder what it's like?

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.790
Like I care.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:52.140
I'm sure it's gloomy and depressing anyway.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.110
B-Beelze-sama?

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.380
What'll I do?

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.430
This feels like...

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.680
My arm, it's...

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.430
T-This is bad!

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.600
Beelze-sama!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.560
Why?

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.890
T-This is...

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:24.440
<b>Baby Beel -> Demon World
 Me -> Dead</b>

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:23.060
If Baby Beel heads to the 
Demon World... I'm dead!

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.110
Where the hell do you think you're going?!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.370
H-He won't let go!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.350
Stop pulling on me!

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:37.160
Shut up! Come back out here again!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:41.070
Don't be crazy! The transfer 
has already started!

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:43.150
F-Furuichi, help me!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.670
S-Sure!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.680
Don't pull on me like that, you perv!

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:50.830
Shut the hell up! I'm gonna die here!

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:53.480
Hilda-san, you too!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.720
Now, hug myself... And 
do a spinning transfer!

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:09.360
This will be trouble.

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:21.580
Crap... What happened?

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.040
You awake?

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:33.010
Hey... Don't tell me, this is...

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:36.280
Yes. It's the Demon World!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.900
A-Are you kidding me?!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.290
Are they finally here?

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:49.280
Then, we shall go, yes?

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:50.830
Enough questions!

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.410
Reach.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:02.410
Cool! Wasn't I just like, totally cool?!

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.480
Something's here...

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:16.670
Yopalelime...

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:23.140
Yople!

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:26.480
It's okay if I punch it, right?

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.510
Wait. I think it's trying to speak to us.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.250
We should just say "Yople" back to it, yeah?

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:36.030
Seriously? Is "Yople" some kind of greeting?

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.660
Yople.

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:45.710
Yople!!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.200
Yopolomeli... papi!

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:50.910
Yople!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.780
Yople!

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:03.430
What the hell have you people done?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.510
It attacked us.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:08.010
It was just saying hi!

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:13.400
The Yople aliens are the friendliest 
tribe of Demons in this area!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.460
How the hell should I know that?

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:19.320
And wait... Yople Aliens? 
Are they aliens or Demons?

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:22.080
Demons...

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:25.590
I went and brought humans 
to the Demon World...

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:29.620
Plus... Plus, of all the places...

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.380
This is Vlad's Haunt!

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:37.510
Vlad's Haunt?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.720
What's that?

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.720
Vlad's Haunt!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:47.730
It's the valley where it's said that 
the Ruler of Time, Vlad Dracul,

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.570
<b>Shivembling = Shivering and trembling</b>

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:50.420
once went exploring, and 
came back all shivembling!

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.060
Vlad said this:

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:54.210
That place is way scary!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:58.850
Yes! This is a truly 
frightful, dangerous place!

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:03.740
There are ancient Demon Beasts 
and poachers that are after them!

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:07.150
Well, I don't really care.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:10.440
Yeah. We just have to go back in Alaindelon.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.750
That's right! Alaindelon!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:14.250
Yes?

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.240
I do apologize...

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:23.510
This is what happens when you 
exceed the maximum occupancy...

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.340
He's all banged up...

00:10:28.610 --> 00:10:29.650
I'm going to fall now.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:35.530
It looks like the transference 
pathways are misaligned.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.080
What? There is no need to fear.

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:40.860
A little sleep, and these 
light wounds will...

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.040
See, I'm feeling more at ease already...

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:46.300
Don't go to sleep! What'll we do if you die?

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:49.960
Yeah, seriously! Don't you die! 
If you die I'll friggin' kill you!

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:54.800
What? I'm not going to die 
from something like this.

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:59.160
It's almost my daughter's 
birthday, you see...

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:04.770
I promised to buy her a new dress...

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:07.360
That's a total death flag!

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.200
Lamia, you're a doctor, aren't you?

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:10.320
Do something!

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:12.360
I have been!

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.840
But for wounds like this, 
without the doctor...

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:19.790
Speaking of which... 
Where'd that flaky guy go?

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.300
He was the only one who transferred properly.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:28.270
Lamia-dono... I leave the rest to you...

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:42.490
Alaindelon!

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:47.750
Okay, now you're really screwing with me!

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.000
Open your eyes, you!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.420
I told you, this ain't no time to die!

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.120
No mercy...

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:56.960
I said open your damn eyes!

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:01.430
It's a communicator!

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:04.300
A communicator?

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:06.310
Hello? Hello...

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:07.530
Is that you, Lamia?

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:08.580
Are you safe?

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:10.620
Miss Hilda!

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.160
Hilda-san!

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.630
Damn it, Hilda!

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.750
I was contacted by Doctor Furcas.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.380
It looks like you are all safe?

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.770
But Alaindelon is...

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.130
Exceeded his capacity, yes?

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:26.640
So where are you now?

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:31.360
I see. Those lands are protected. The 
Kingdom cannot lay a hand on them.

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:33.800
Don't tell me... Have you done 
something to a local inhabitant?

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:35.880
Actually, there was this Yople Alien, and...

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.220
You did what?!

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:37.900
Yople...

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.730
Those are Vlad's watchmen!

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.220
That sound...

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:50.280
Run! It's calling an ally!

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:52.150
Its ally?

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:53.420
Akubaba!

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.320
Akubaba?

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:58.410
Like the one you rode on, Hilda-san?

00:12:58.410 --> 00:12:59.840
In that case, you could...

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.080
Yeah! One swift kick and...

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.880
Really?

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:04.760
Fools!

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.550
I should tell you...

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.580
Wild Akubabas...

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:15.910
...are huge!

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:17.220
No way!

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:20.690
Stop screwing with me! This thing's 
a completely different creature!

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.010
That's why I told you to run!

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:27.030
Right now you are considered an 
enemy everywhere within Vlad!

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:29.540
Then where should we be running?

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:49.930
Baby Beel is standing!

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:57.680
Baby Beel!

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:16.430
Whoa! Did he power up from 
coming to the Demon World?

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:21.170
It sounds like you were saved 
by the master's true power.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:25.180
But you shouldn't let down your 
guard. Listen exactly to what I say.

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:29.990
You are to search out Alaindelon's 
daughter. Ask her to transfer you.

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:32.280
Do not fear, I will guide you.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.180
Oh, got it.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:43.930
Humans, huh? That's a rare 
prey. What'll we do, Gallé?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:53.970
Man... Why do I have to 
be in a place this nuts?

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:58.780
Stop your grumbling! We're just 
doing exactly as Miss Hilda says.

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:02.070
I'm thirsty!

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:03.660
And I'm hungry!

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.010
An apple!

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:15.720
So bitter! What the heck?

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.810
You ate it, didn't you?

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:24.210
Where? Where have you gone, Yukie?!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:29.210
Shinji-san, if you truly love 
me, you'll know that I'm here!

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.570
I can sense Yukie over there!

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.910
No! I'm over here, Shinji-san!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.700
Are you here, Yukie? Somewhere in this snow!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:44.490
Yukie is right here, Shinji-san...

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:47.000
I want to see you, and yet...

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:51.360
There you are Yukie! Yes, there!

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:56.180
Yukie!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.710
And the two pass by each other once again.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:10.790
It's no use. Let's end this, Shinji-san!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:12.100
Yukie!

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:12.990
Shinji-san!

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.110
Yukie!

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:15.080
Shinji-san!

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:15.970
Yukie!

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:16.880
What is it?

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.290
Please, eat more!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.830
It looks like it's forcing him to eat.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.350
A Demon Apple Tree, yes?

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:34.640
They force you to eat their 
fruit through any means.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.680
Don't worry, it'll get bored soon enough.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.780
Soon enough?

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:52.540
Now, you too!

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:55.200
Don't want any.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:07.460
How cruel... I know that I'm bitter...

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:11.150
And I know that my skins 
are dry, and I'm tall...

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:17.240
But I almost never get any customers 
in a dark, damp place like this!

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:21.140
It'll really help me if you just eat one...

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.060
I said I don't want any.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:33.990
A normal person would just 
eat it after saying all this!

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.620
Apple!

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:39.320
You...

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.560
I can't tell which one's the Demon here...

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:48.850
Even if you call me a demon, 
I'll keep on loving you!

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:52.300
You're a demon! A demon, I say!

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:53.870
What is it now?

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.550
Haven't things calmed down?

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:57.200
The flower...!

00:17:57.200 --> 00:18:01.070
Why is it always me? Stop it, that tickles!

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:03.900
What is it this time?

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.480
Man, this stinks!

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:12.630
A Demon Rafflesia, I suppose?

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:14.900
It catches its prey through a special scent.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.700
Don't worry. It'll get bored soon enough.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.420
What the hell does soon enough mean?!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.640
Eww!

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:26.100
Yople!

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.330
The hell... Man.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.280
You really saved me there!

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:37.280
You stink!

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.550
W-Wait! Wait for me!

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.310
Is that it?

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:50.560
Thanks to the help of <i>someone</i>, we 
arrived faster than we thought.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:53.260
Why are you standing so far from me?

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:57.540
We'll go on the road. You swim up the river.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:59.200
Agreed.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.530
Damn you!

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:03.020
So this is Alaindelon's house?

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.710
No, no... This is his daughter's house.

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:08.660
She seems to do research 
on ancient Demon Beasts.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:11.830
That's why she lives so far out 
from the Demon Kingdom, I hear.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:16.840
The water was freezing! 
I'm gonna catch a cold...

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:19.240
You actually swam up here?

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:21.220
You bastard!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.720
And hey...

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.470
I just can't get excited about this.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.730
About what?

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:30.600
I mean, think about it, man.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.560
She's <i>his</i> daughter!

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:34.580
I bet she's all...

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.840
You've got such a pitiful imagination.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.380
She'd be more like this, right?

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.150
What? You say that's not it?

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:51.000
Then, how about you, Baby Beel?

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:00.460
Are you all idiots?

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:05.050
And they all had mustaches... 
Even Beelze-sama's squid...

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.340
Excuse us!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:12.020
The door is open, so we'll be coming inside.

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:18.160
Abandoned?

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.410
No...

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:23.160
The broken stuff is still new.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.680
There isn't anyone here.

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:28.280
Perhaps it was the poachers.

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:29.660
Poachers?

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:30.640
Yes.

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:35.050
They're people who sell rare Demon Beasts...

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:37.980
They may have been after 
her ability to transfer.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.580
Yes, that's right!

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:45.570
And you people are going to become my wares!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:48.880
Weak humans can't stand up to us!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.430
Edda, handle this!

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:52.310
Yeah!

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:03.150
Yople.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:04.220
Wait, wha...?

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:08.660
W-Wait, hold it... Are you really a human?

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:11.660
That mark...

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.770
That's the Royal Crest!

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:16.900
You're in a contract with the royal family?

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:18.420
That's right Yople!

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:19.670
Yople!

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:22.770
Their base should be nearby.

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:25.080
I bet she is there.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:29.870
In other words, we have to go rescue her!

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:33.550
This has started to get complicated...

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:35.970
A picture?

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:43.140
Hey, Furuichi...

00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:45.620
We're going to wipe out 
a band of thieves now.

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:47.260
Man, what a pain.

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:49.770
What are you saying, Oga-kun?

00:21:50.980 --> 00:21:53.840
Our goal is to rescue the lovely damsel!

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:55.330
Let us go!

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:43.490
As things are, they would have had 
no choice but to head there...

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:48.390
If I go there, I'll learn something!

00:23:48.390 --> 00:23:50.030
To be Yopled.

00:24:02.040 --> 00:24:05.300
Our trip has only yet begun! 
As have my adventures!

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:06.030
Yople!

00:24:06.030 --> 00:24:06.950
Yopelalime?

00:24:06.950 --> 00:24:09.020
Wait, my darling!

00:24:09.020 --> 00:24:09.750
Yople!

00:24:09.750 --> 00:24:10.600
Yopolomelopapi!

00:24:10.600 --> 00:24:12.050
And cut it out with the Yoples already!

00:24:12.050 --> 00:24:13.850
And who the hell is this "lovely"?

00:24:13.850 --> 00:24:16.120
It's Alaindelon's daughter, duh!

00:24:16.120 --> 00:24:18.270
Wait for me. I will save you, for sure!

00:24:18.270 --> 00:24:20.540
And Furuichi put on a very happy face.

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:23.320
On the next Beelzebub: 
Welcome Back, Demon World!

00:24:23.320 --> 00:24:26.070
When this battle is over, 
I'm going to get marri...

00:24:26.070 --> 00:24:26.520
Yople!

00:24:26.520 --> 00:24:27.500
Gople!
